WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:11.058
Hi! 345 plus 30 can be done in your head. Today we'll add and subtract ones, tens and hundreds mentally.

2
00:00:11.208 --> 00:00:17.946
Adding ones changes only the ones: 5 plus 3 is 8, so 348.

3
00:00:18.096 --> 00:00:26.394
Adding tens changes only the tens: 4 tens plus 3 tens is 7 tens, so 375.

4
00:00:26.544 --> 00:00:31.746
Adding hundreds changes only the hundreds: 645.

5
00:00:31.896 --> 00:00:41.850
Subtraction works the same: 528 minus 200 only changes the hundreds: 328.

6
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.234
396 plus 5: in the ones, 6 plus 5 is 11, so we regroup.

7
00:00:48.384 --> 00:00:56.586
Make a round number first: 396 plus 4 is 400, then add 1 to get 401.

8
00:00:56.736 --> 00:01:04.818
452 minus 70: take 50 to get 402, then 20 more to get 382.

9
00:01:04.968 --> 00:01:10.290
After working it out, check: did the right place change?

10
00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:15.090
Watch out! 30 is 3 tens, not 3 ones!

11
00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:20.394
Add it to the tens: 4 tens plus 3 tens is 7 tens.

12
00:01:20.544 --> 00:01:26.922
So 345 plus 30 is 375.

13
00:01:27.072 --> 00:01:35.850
Your turn! What is 261 plus 7? Pause and think.

14
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:44.826
Only the ones change: 1 plus 7 is 8, so 268. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:44.976 --> 00:01:54.210
Another one! What is 672 minus 40? Pause and think.

16
00:01:54.360 --> 00:02:04.578
Only the tens change: 7 tens minus 4 tens is 3 tens, so 632. Did you get it right?

17
00:02:04.728 --> 00:02:13.938
Here's another! What is 415 plus 400? Pause and think.

18
00:02:14.088 --> 00:02:22.650
Only the hundreds change: 4 plus 4 is 8, so 815. Did you get it right?

19
00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:31.818
Try one more! What is 598 plus 6? Pause and think.

20
00:02:31.968 --> 00:02:42.234
Make a round number: 598 plus 2 is 600, then plus 4 is 604. Did you get it right?

21
00:02:42.384 --> 00:02:51.234
Last one! What is 830 minus 50? Pause and think.

22
00:02:51.384 --> 00:02:59.010
Take 30 to get 800, then 20 more to get 780. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:07.170
Remember: adding ones, tens or hundreds changes just that place. When regrouping, make a round number first.

24
00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:12.282
In your head: what is your age plus 100?

